3. Data Collection & Privacy
- We collect and store your device's MAC address and IP address for network management
- Session data including login times and traffic metadata may be logged
- We do not monitor or store the content of your communications
- Collected data is used for network security and service improvement only

4. Security
- This is a shared network - use appropriate security measures for sensitive activities
- We recommend using VPN for sensitive transactions
- You are responsible for the security of your own devices
- The network may block certain ports and protocols for security reasons

5. Service Limitations
- Network access is provided "as is" without guarantees of availability or speed
- We reserve the right to terminate your access at any time
- Maintenance windows may result in temporary service interruptions
